{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05381","headline":"广陵送别宋员外佐越郑舍人还京 · 韦述","name":"广陵送别宋员外佐越郑舍人还京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱绂临秦望，皇华赴洛桥。\n文章南渡越，书奏北归朝。\n树入江云尽，城衔海月遥。\n秋风将客思，川上晚萧萧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦述","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}